  "description": "General Map - 全自定义酒馆地图插件：这款插件专为所有SillyTavern用户设计，旨在提供一个全动态、高自由度的交互式地图系统。它彻底摒弃了硬编码的静态结构，将世界的构建权完全交还给你！This plugin is designed exclusively for all SillyTavern users, aiming to provide a fully dynamic, highly flexible interactive map system. It completely abandons hard-coded static structures, putting the power to build your world entirely back in you",
